    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/merge-to-main.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Merge to `main` — a sub-process with its own gate",
      "prov:value": "Today that is\n`merge-train.bpmn` (`Call_MergeToMain`, in place of the old `Task_Release` and\n`Task_Land`) and `crdm-close.bpmn` (`Call_MergeToMain`, between the recorded\nsign-off and the issue close)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/merge-to-main.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Why this is a process of its own",
      "prov:value": "**2026-10-09:** one session merged seven pull requests into `main` across seven\nrepositories (cat-harness, bootstrap-tools, the tools layer above this one, and\nfour content instances above that). None of those\nrepositories runs CI. The owner's instruction had been *\"fix all issues until\ngreen\"*, and the session read it as permission to merge. A safety classifier\nflagged the action as \"Merge Without Review\". The same instruction then appeared\nas the `evidence` of two `trust.consent` re-pins in `folio-assistant`'s\n`index.config.json`.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-09"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/merge-to-main.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "The steps",
      "prov:value": "With none active, the PR's own session takes the lane\n(owner ruling 2026-10-06, [`merge-queue`](merge-queue.md) §\"When no Merge\nManager is active\").",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-06"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/merge-to-main.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Authorisation — who, and what counts",
      "prov:value": "**A batch authorisation covers the PRs listed when it was\ngiven**, not PRs that arrive later (owner, 2026-10-04, quoted in\n[`merge-queue`](merge-queue.md) §Landing).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-04"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/merge-to-main.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recording the authorisation (not relaxable)",
      "prov:value": "The shape\nalready exists: `ReleaseSchema` in `schemas/sdlc/merge-queue.ts` (bean `ixmq`), and\nthis step reuses it rather than inventing a second one.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean ixmq"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/merge-to-main.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "After the merge",
      "prov:value": "A\n   merge that changes what a published site shows is not done until the site\n   shows it (owner, 2026-10-30: *\"merged PRs by agent should trigger page\n   rebuild in process\"*).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-30"
